Board of trustees-systems of public recreation
SF0047
amendment.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Landen, Anderson, Ide and Schuler and
Representative(s) Allemand, Byron and Campbell, E
AN ACT relating to public recreation and playgrounds; authorizing the governing
body of a city, town, county or school district to act as a board of trustees
for a system of public recreation as specified; making conforming amendments;
and providing for an effective date.
